{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45439","headline":"谢白乐天招 · 韬光","name":"谢白乐天招","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山僧野性好林泉，每向岩阿倚石眠。\n不解栽松陪玉勒，惟能引水种金莲。\n白云乍可来青嶂，明月难教下碧天。\n城市不能飞锡去，恐妨莺啭翠楼前。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韬光","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45439.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45439","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}